{/*
	Basic Consent Mode: gtm.js loads only after Analytics or Marketing is granted. `tbLoadGtm` runs for a choice
	stored on an earlier visit (after `load`, below) and for one made on this page (CookieConsent.astro).
	Global Privacy Control overrides a stored Marketing grant (CCPA regs §7025) for this page; the cookie is left as saved.
*/}
